<title>FINLAND: Rauma says won FIM 85 mln crusher orders.</title>
<headline>Rauma says won FIM 85 mln crusher orders.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy said in a statement on Wednesday its Nordberg unit had won orders for crushers and crushing equipment worth about 85 million markka from the mining industry in Chile.</p>
<p>&quot;Nordberg, the crusher manufacturing business group of Rauma, received orders for 14 large crushers and other crushing process equipment from the rapidly growing mining industry of Chile at the end of 1996,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
